fsv (3.0-0) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Initial packaging.
  * Rate-limit gui_update() during filesystem scanning to ~60fps to avoid
    throttling stat calls to ~750/sec.
  * Fix O(n²) GList building in MapV layout engine (g_list_append walks the
    full list on every call); switch to prepend + reverse.

